    {
      "entry": 7357,
      "name": "Mordresh Fire Eye",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:7357:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:55eb173ecec319469285690b",
            "source:5755252781b8e29cf452ae35",
            "source:fd392ecbdcdd3948f13419c9",
            "source:33bfb6008832d61356fe4121"
          ],
          "text": "Mordresh Fire Eye declares his ambition to see the Scourge rule the world, enslave the quilboar and spread across the barren land. In battle he calls on his brethren to fight for the Scourge, marking him as a commander as well as an advocate for its expansion.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 7357
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 7358,
      "name": "Amnennar the Coldbringer",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:7358:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:65b34eba9e63b4b5181dd155",
            "source:81941d2840037a402fca7bfe",
            "source:434924f61eeabd5f2b277b50",
            "source:2f0b7cfef68441e4e58c960d",
            "source:f50676082e22ff49a739af77",
            "source:e890bec5bba35be9b35895df",
            "source:14746a05e34f029215847a89"
          ],
          "text": "Amnennar the Coldbringer is a Scourge lich serving the Lich King and ruling the Scourge-aligned quilboar of Razorfen Downs. He commands servants and spirits, calling wraiths from the freezing air, and meets intruders with threats and contempt.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 7358
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 8516,
      "name": "Belnistrasz",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:8516:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:0acd2521e052adedea2fea7e",
            "source:5762dc1a4d02139b0890f839",
            "source:c293478fa4fb13d62ce7446a",
            "source:ca1ab699f12033edf1a2d092",
            "source:29274d5c48512b66f59530b3"
          ],
          "text": "Belnistrasz is an outsider rescued in Razorfen Downs who chooses to confront the danger there rather than flee. He says he cares little for Horde or Alliance politics and wants to stop threats to all peoples. He asks for help against the Scourge and quilboar, and can perform a ritual to shut down the quilboar idol while allies protect him.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 8516
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 8567,
      "name": "Glutton",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:8567:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:0cf684988b5edee7fabacd77",
            "source:ab0fe038156d89084c8e1810",
            "source:f484d62be5445231bc7ffa80",
            "source:2061e3e24d7afac25ffd20c1",
            "source:dd7fb5d7a48a3af733b5dedb"
          ],
          "text": "Glutton is a ravenous undead foe whose speech fixates on hunger and the living: it detects their stench, threatens to feast on them, and grows increasingly hungry as it weakens. Its encounter voice presents it as a predatory creature, not a conversational service.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 8567
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 8696,
      "name": "Henry Stern",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:8696:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:b6f1257ae7b79bd1221b14ca",
            "source:e514cba61b2794d91aac5a30",
            "source:10a17dd58b6ac8cb88bb59ae",
            "source:c4fac336fe4ad2a1429ce831",
            "source:5d2ab94e011600258f431a85"
          ],
          "text": "Henry Stern is a cook and alchemist from Stormwind, captured by quilboar while seeking local herbs and recipes for his uncle Angus. In his account, he thanks his rescuer and says he will wait until it is safe to leave. His dialogue connects his work with cooking recipes and alchemy lessons.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 8696
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 8767,
